  "title": "CRH Confirms Date for Q2 2026 Results",
  "summary": "NEW YORK – July 9, 2026 – CRH (NYSE: CRH), the leading provider of building materials, will publish its Q2 2026 financial results before market open on Thursday, July 30, 2026, in advance of a conference call and webcast presentation at 8:00 a.m. (EDT). CRH’s results and the related presentation will be available at www.crh.com/investors/results-presentations. […]",
